              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Vuka, ukhale ebusuku; thulula inhliziyo yakho njengamanzi phambi kukaJehova ekuqaleni kwemilindo; phakamisela kuye izandla zakho ngenxa yokuphila kwabantwana bakho abafa yindlala ezingqongeni zonke zemigwaqo.",
          "type": "text",
